    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254210/extras/671c359168436970b4e8428207e01b10.poster.avif?t=1674308558\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254210/extras/671c359168436970b4e8428207e01b10.webm?t=1674308558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254210/extras/671c359168436970b4e8428207e01b10.mp4?t=1674308558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Xavier</strong> the cat is missing. In order to find him, you will have to explore the surrounding area and use <strong>precise platforming</strong> in order to progress. While exploring you will find beans, which are needed to unlock different types of <strong>abilities</strong>. These abilities are required in order to access new areas. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254210/extras/af448b4a2b56756ed78f3d1a2c93e9ef.poster.avif?t=1674308558\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254210/extras/af448b4a2b56756ed78f3d1a2c93e9ef.webm?t=1674308558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254210/extras/af448b4a2b56756ed78f3d1a2c93e9ef.mp4?t=1674308558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>A heads up! The game is fairly short, especially if you are experienced with platformers.</i>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254210/extras/671c359168436970b4e8428207e01b10.poster.avif?t=1674308558\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254210/extras/671c359168436970b4e8428207e01b10.webm?t=1674308558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254210/extras/671c359168436970b4e8428207e01b10.mp4?t=1674308558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Xavier</strong> the cat is missing. In order to find him, you will have to explore the surrounding area and use <strong>precise platforming</strong> in order to progress. While exploring you will find beans, which are needed to unlock different types of <strong>abilities</strong>. These abilities are required in order to access new areas. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254210/extras/af448b4a2b56756ed78f3d1a2c93e9ef.poster.avif?t=1674308558\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254210/extras/af448b4a2b56756ed78f3d1a2c93e9ef.webm?t=1674308558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254210/extras/af448b4a2b56756ed78f3d1a2c93e9ef.mp4?t=1674308558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>A heads up! The game is fairly short, especially if you are experienced with platformers.</i>",
